+<A NAME="lbAB">&nbsp;</A>
+<H2>NAME</H2>
+
+<B>oscam.guess</B> - CAID guessing table for OSCam
+<A NAME="lbAC">&nbsp;</A>
+<H2>SYNOPSIS</H2>
+
+CAID guessing table
+<A NAME="lbAD">&nbsp;</A>
+<H2>DESCRIPTIONS</H2>
+
+<P>
+
+<B>&lt;length of ECM&gt;</B>:<B>&lt;CAID&gt;</B>
+<DL COMPACT><DT><DD>
+CAID guessing table by len in hex, only needed for protocols (at the moment BOMBA protocol only) that does not pass CAIDs
+</DL>
+
+<A NAME="lbAE">&nbsp;</A>
+<H2>EXAMPLES</H2>
+
+<BR>&nbsp;12:3456
+<A NAME="lbAF">&nbsp;</A>
+<H2>SEE ALSO</H2>
